  'Option A (correct) is AWS Trusted Advisor, which provides real-time guidance to help you provision your resources following AWS best practices across five categories. Option B, AWS Health Dashboard, provides personalized information about AWS service health events. Option C, Amazon CloudWatch, is a monitoring and observability service. Option D, AWS Budgets, allows you to set custom budgets to track your cost and usage, but it does not provide recommendations across all five categories.',
