  'Option C (correct) describes the primary function of AWS Trusted Advisor. It inspects your AWS environment and provides real-time recommendations in five categories: cost optimization, performance, security, fault tolerance, and service limits. Option A (incorrect) describes the AWS Health Dashboard. Option B (incorrect) describes Amazon CloudWatch Logs. Option D (incorrect) describes AWS Systems Manager Automation.',
