  '{3}'::int[],
  'Option D (S3 Cross-Region Replication) is the correct feature for automatically replicating objects to a different AWS Region for disaster recovery. This ensures data durability and availability even in the event of a regional outage. Option A (S3 Versioning) protects against accidental deletions/overwrites within the same bucket. Option B (S3 Lifecycle Policies) manages object transitions between storage classes or expiration. Option C (S3 Transfer Acceleration) speeds up data transfers to S3 over long distances.',
