  '{2}'::int[],
  'Option C (Automatically adjusts read/write capacity based on actual workload, suitable for unpredictable traffic) correctly describes Amazon DynamoDB On-Demand capacity mode. It eliminates the need to specify read and write throughput capacity in advance. Option A and B describe aspects of Provisioned capacity mode. Option D describes storage services like Amazon S3 Glacier, not DynamoDB.',
