  '{2}'::int[],
  'Option C (Automatically increases database storage capacity when needed, up to a specified maximum) is the correct benefit of Amazon RDS storage auto-scaling. It helps prevent database outages due to insufficient storage by automatically expanding the volume. Option A is incorrect; RDS storage auto-scaling only increases capacity. Option B (Improves database read performance) is achieved with Read Replicas or caching. Option D (Encrypts database storage) is a separate feature of RDS.',
