  '{3}'::int[],
  'Option D (Health checks to monitor target status) is the Elastic Load Balancing feature that ensures only healthy instances receive traffic. The load balancer periodically sends requests to registered targets and stops sending traffic to unhealthy ones. Option A (Sticky sessions) ensures a user''s requests are sent to the same instance. Option B (Cross-Zone Load Balancing) distributes traffic evenly across Availability Zones. Option C (Listener rules) define how the load balancer routes requests to target groups.',
