  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is Amazon EventBridge, a serverless event bus that enables you to easily connect applications together using data from your own applications, integrated SaaS applications, and AWS services. It supports scheduled events and event-driven architectures. Option A, AWS CloudFormation, is for provisioning infrastructure as code. Option B, AWS CodeDeploy, is for automating application deployments. Option D, AWS Service Catalog, is for creating and managing catalogs of approved IT services.',
