  'Option B (AWS Security Hub) is the correct service. AWS Security Hub provides a comprehensive view of your security posture across your AWS accounts. It collects security data from across AWS accounts, services, and supported third-party partners, and helps you analyze your security trends. Option A (AWS CloudTrail) logs API activity. Option C (Amazon CloudWatch) is for monitoring resources and applications. Option D (AWS Organizations) helps manage multiple AWS accounts.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain25_5',
