  '{0}'::int[],
  'Option A (correct) is the primary benefit of AWS Savings Plans. They offer lower prices on AWS compute usage (EC2, Fargate, Lambda) in exchange for a commitment to a consistent amount of usage (measured in $/hour) for a 1- or 3-year term, providing significant cost savings. Option B describes On-Demand pricing. Option C describes Amazon EC2 Spot Instances. Option D describes the benefit of Auto Scaling.',
