  'Option B (It caches content at edge locations to reduce latency and improve performance for global users.) correctly describes the primary benefit of Amazon CloudFront. As a content delivery network (CDN), CloudFront distributes content from origin servers to edge locations worldwide, serving content closer to users, which significantly reduces latency and improves the user experience. Option A describes Amazon RDS. Option C describes Elastic Load Balancing. Option D describes services like Amazon Kinesis.',
