  'Option C (correct) allows you to define and execute automated workflows (runbooks) to perform operational tasks like patching, updating, or troubleshooting. Option A (correct) enables the execution of custom scripts or commands on managed instances, providing flexibility for specific operational needs. Option B is a function of CloudWatch Logs Insights. Option D is the primary role of AWS CloudTrail. Option E is handled by AWS Config.',
