  'Option D (correct) provides recommendations across five categories: cost optimization, performance, security, fault tolerance, and service limits. Option B (correct) provides personalized information about events that affect your AWS resources, helping you stay informed about potential operational impacts. Option A is for querying log data. Option C logs API activity. Option E tracks resource configuration changes and evaluates compliance.',
