  '{0,1}'::int[],
  'Option A (correct) accurately states that Patch Manager automates the patching of operating systems and applications, ensuring instances are up-to-date with security fixes. Option B (correct) highlights that it allows defining custom patch baselines, giving administrators control over which patches are approved or rejected for specific environments. Option C (incorrect) describes the function of AWS CodeDeploy, not Patch Manager. Option D (incorrect) is a task typically handled by database services or dedicated backup solutions, not Patch Manager. Option E (incorrect) describes a key feature of AWS Systems Manager Session Manager, not Patch Manager.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain24_5',
  NOW(),
  2,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_24_2',
  'easy'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

