  '{2,3,0,1}'::int[],
  'To create an EventBridge rule, you first specify the event source, which could be an AWS service or a custom application (Option C). Next, you define the event pattern, a JSON structure that EventBridge uses to match incoming events (Option D). After defining the pattern, you choose a target, such as an AWS Lambda function or an Amazon SNS topic, that will be invoked when an event matches the pattern (Option A). Finally, you create the EventBridge rule, which then becomes active and starts processing events (Option B).',
