  '{1,3,0,2}'::int[],
  'To configure an Amazon EventBridge rule, you first navigate to the Amazon EventBridge console (Option B). Next, you create a new rule and provide it with a descriptive name (Option D). Then, you define the event pattern (Option A) that will filter incoming events, specifically looking for the state change of your CloudWatch alarm to ''ALARM''. Finally, you select the AWS Lambda function (Option C) that should be invoked as the target for this rule when the event pattern is matched.',
