  '{1,0,2,3}'::int[],
  'To execute an AWS Systems Manager Automation document, you first navigate to the AWS Systems Manager console and select ''Automation'' (Option B). Next, you select the specific Automation document (Option A) that contains the pre-defined steps or script you wish to run. Then, you specify the target EC2 instances or a resource group (Option C) on which the automation should be executed. Finally, you review all the execution details and initiate the automation (Option D) to apply the changes to your instances.',
