  '{1,2,0,3}'::int[],
  'To review recommendations from AWS Trusted Advisor, you first navigate to the AWS Management Console (Option B). From there, you select the AWS Trusted Advisor service (Option C) from the services list. Once in the Trusted Advisor dashboard, you can review the recommendations organized by category, such as Cost Optimization or Performance (Option A). Finally, for specific issues, you can drill down into individual recommendations (Option D) to get detailed information and suggested remediation steps.',
