  'To set up an EventBridge rule for EC2 instance state changes, you first navigate to the Amazon EventBridge console (Option B). Next, you create a new rule, providing a name and description (Option D). Then, you select ''EC2 Instance State-change Notification'' as the event type (Option A) to filter for these specific events. Finally, you configure a target, such as an Amazon SNS topic or AWS Lambda function (Option C), which will be invoked or notified when an EC2 instance state change occurs.',
