  'To use AWS Systems Manager Run Command, you first navigate to the AWS Systems Manager console and select ''Run Command'' (Option B). Next, you select the appropriate Systems Manager document for running scripts, typically `AWS-RunShellScript` (Option A). Then, you specify the target EC2 instances on which the script should run and provide the actual script content (Option C). Finally, you execute the command and monitor its status (Option D) to ensure it completes successfully and gather the diagnostic information.',
