  '{1,0,3,2}'::int[],
  'To configure AWS Systems Manager Patch Manager for automated patching, you first navigate to the AWS Systems Manager console and select ''Patch Manager'' (Option B). Next, you create a patch baseline (Option A) that specifies which patches are approved or rejected for your instances. Then, you specify the target EC2 instances (Option D) that will be subject to this patching configuration. Finally, you configure a patching schedule (Option C) using a maintenance window to define when the automated patching operations will occur, minimizing disruption.',
