  '["Define the event pattern for the desired operational event (e.g., EC2 instance state change).","Configure the Lambda function as a target for the EventBridge rule.","Create an Amazon EventBridge rule with the defined event pattern.","Create an AWS Lambda function to perform the desired action."]'::json,
