  '{2,1,0,3}'::int[],
  'Option C (Create an Application Load Balancer) is the initial component to set up. Option B (Create a target group for the EC2 instances) defines the group of instances that will receive traffic. Option A (Register EC2 instances with the target group) links the actual instances to the target group. Option D (Configure a listener on the ALB to forward requests to the target group) is the final step to direct incoming traffic to the appropriate target group.',
