  'Option D (Create the Route 53 health check) is the initial action to start the process. Option A (Specify the endpoint to monitor) is essential to tell Route 53 what to check. Option B (Define the health check protocol) determines how Route 53 will attempt to reach the endpoint. Option C (Configure advanced settings like failure threshold and request interval) fine-tune the health check''s behavior and sensitivity.',
