  '{2,1,3,0}'::int[],
  'Option C (Create a destination S3 bucket in a different AWS Region) is a prerequisite for replication. Option B (Enable Versioning on both source and destination S3 buckets) is mandatory for S3 Cross-Region Replication to function. Option D (Configure an IAM role with necessary replication permissions) grants S3 the authority to replicate objects. Option A (Create a replication rule on the source S3 bucket) defines the specific replication behavior.',
