  'To provision a product using AWS Service Catalog, a user first needs to access the service. Option B (Access the AWS Service Catalog console) is the initial step. Once in the console, the user selects the product they wish to provision, as in Option A (Select the desired product from the Service Catalog portfolio). After selection, they configure any required parameters and initiate the launch, which is Option C (Configure product parameters and launch the product). Finally, the user monitors the provisioning process and accesses the resources once they are ready, as in Option D (Monitor the provisioning status and access the provisioned resources).',
