  '["Generate a change set from the updated template.","Identify the drifted resources using CloudFormation drift detection.","Update the CloudFormation template to match the desired state, incorporating any necessary manual changes.","Execute the change set to apply the template''s desired state, reverting manual changes."]'::json,
  '{1,2,0,3}'::int[],
  'When manual changes cause CloudFormation stack drift, the first step is to identify the specific drifted resources using CloudFormation''s built-in drift detection feature (Option B). Next, the CloudFormation template should be updated to accurately reflect the desired state of the infrastructure, potentially incorporating any manual changes that were intended to be permanent (Option C). After the template is updated, a change set is generated from this new template against the existing stack (Option A). Finally, the change set is executed to apply the template''s desired state, which will revert any unintended manual changes and bring the stack back into compliance with its definition (Option D). This approach ensures all changes are managed through CloudFormation, preventing future drift.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain24_5',
  NOW(),
  27,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_24_1',
  'medium'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

