  '{3,0,1,2}'::int[],
  'To set up AWS CodeDeploy for automated application deployments, the initial step is to configure the target EC2 instances by installing the CodeDeploy agent and attaching the necessary IAM roles for communication (Option D). Next, you create an application and a deployment group within AWS CodeDeploy, specifying the deployment type and target instances (Option A). After the setup, you prepare the application revision, which includes the application files and an AppSpec file defining the deployment lifecycle (Option B). Finally, you deploy the application revision to the created deployment group, initiating the automated deployment process (Option C).',
