VALUES (
  'q_25_m_25_1_139',
  'A SysOps Administrator needs to implement preventive guardrails across multiple AWS accounts within an AWS Organization to ensure that no account can launch EC2 instances in unsupported regions. Arrange the steps to achieve this using Service Control Policies (SCPs).',
