  '{3,2,0,1}'::int[],
  'Implementing SCPs for preventive guardrails follows a specific order. Option D (Organize AWS accounts into Organizational Units (OUs)) is typically the first step to structure your accounts for policy application. Option C (Create the Service Control Policy (SCP) document) is where the actual policy logic is defined. Option A (Attach the SCP to the target Organizational Unit (OU) or individual accounts) applies the policy to the desired scope. Option B (Test the SCP''s effect) is crucial to verify that the policy is working as intended and blocking the specified actions.',
