  '{2,1,3,0}'::int[],
  'Deploying Amazon GuardDuty begins with activation. Option C (Enable Amazon GuardDuty in the AWS console) is the first step to activate the service. Option B (Configure trusted IP lists and threat lists) allows for customization to reduce false positives and enhance detection accuracy. Option D (Set up notifications for critical findings) ensures that the security team is alerted to potential threats. Option A (Review security findings and alerts) is the ongoing operational task of monitoring and responding to GuardDuty''s output.',
