  'To associate a route table with a subnet, first navigate to the VPC console and select ''Route Tables'' (Option A). Then, select the specific route table you intend to associate (Option B). Within the route table details, go to the ''Subnet associations'' tab and click ''Edit subnet associations'' (Option C). Finally, select the desired target subnet(s) from the list and save the changes (Option D) to apply the association.',
