VALUES (
  'q_26_m_26_1_101',
  'A SysOps Administrator is tasked with connecting multiple VPCs in a hub-and-spoke topology within the same AWS Region for centralized network management. Order the steps to achieve this using AWS Transit Gateway.',
  'ordering',
  '["Create a Transit Gateway in the desired AWS Region.","Create Transit Gateway attachments for each VPC (spoke VPCs) that needs to connect to the hub.","Configure Transit Gateway route tables to define how traffic flows between the attached VPCs.","Update the route tables within each attached VPC to direct traffic destined for other VPCs through the Transit Gateway attachment."]'::json,
