VALUES (
  'q_27_m_27_1_134',
  'A company has predictable, long-running Amazon EC2 workloads and wants to reduce costs. Order the following general steps a SysOps Administrator would consider when evaluating and purchasing a cost-saving commitment plan.',
  'ordering',
  '["Analyze historical usage patterns and identify stable, long-term compute needs.","Select the appropriate commitment plan (e.g., EC2 Instance Savings Plan, Compute Savings Plan, Convertible Reserved Instance) based on flexibility and discount.","Determine the commitment term (e.g., 1-year or 3-year) and payment option (e.g., All Upfront, Partial Upfront, No Upfront).","Monitor cost savings and utilization of the purchased commitment plan using AWS Cost Explorer."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}'::int[],
  'The initial step in cost optimization with commitment plans is to Option A (Analyze historical usage patterns and identify stable, long-term compute needs) to understand the workload''s predictability. Based on this analysis, Option B (Select the appropriate commitment plan (e.g., EC2 Instance Savings Plan, Compute Savings Plan, Convertible Reserved Instance) based on flexibility and discount) is chosen. Next, Option C (Determine the commitment term (e.g., 1-year or 3-year) and payment option (e.g., All Upfront, Partial Upfront, No Upfront)) finalizes the purchase specifics. Finally, Option D (Monitor cost savings and utilization of the purchased commitment plan using AWS Cost Explorer) is crucial for ongoing validation and management of the investment.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain27_5',
  NOW(),
  20,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_27_1',
  'hard'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

