  NULL,
  'An Amazon CloudWatch Alarm, when its state changes (e.g., from OK to ALARM), can generate an event that can be sent to Amazon EventBridge. An EventBridge rule can then be configured to match this event pattern, acting as a trigger. An automated response is the action taken by a target service (e.g., AWS Lambda, AWS Systems Manager Automation) when an EventBridge rule is triggered, enabling self-healing architectures.',
