  NULL,
  'Target Tracking (Option A) scaling policies adjust capacity to maintain a specific metric (e.g., 50% CPU utilization) at a target value, providing smoother scaling. Simple Scaling (Option B) policies respond to a single CloudWatch alarm and add or remove a fixed number of instances. Step Scaling (Option C) policies increase or decrease the current capacity of the Auto Scaling group in steps based on a set of scaling adjustments.',
